## About Me

Hi, I'm techidsk, based in Hangzhou. I like turning repeated work into tools, shaping AI workflows into usable systems, and keeping a sharp personal toolbox close at hand.

- Building around full-stack apps, automation, ComfyUI pipelines, prompts, and developer utilities.
- Mostly writing TypeScript, Python, shell scripts, and Docker-flavored glue.
- Interested in useful AI products, practical creative tooling, and small systems that make daily work faster.

